{"date":"1928-11-18","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/38/2e/113650_guw55.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/38/2e/113650_guw55.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/38/2e/113650_guw55.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/38/2e/113650_guw55.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/38/2e/113650_guw55.jpg"},"summary":"《汽船威利号》（Steamboat Willie）是华特迪士尼全球第一出有声的动画片，动画片的主角是著名的米奇老鼠。此影片于1928年11月18日在纽约79街殖民大戏院（Colony Theater）上映，米老鼠的生日便定为了那天。\r\n\r\n片内的米老鼠没有说话，只随着轻快的音乐跃动和吹口哨。其形象博得观众的喜欢，并轰动了全纽约。随即米老鼠就成了举世闻名的“明星”。1932年，这部影片更获得了奥斯卡的特别奖。 据说上映时，纽约人到场看的并非剧情，而是这只可爱的老鼠，在这八分钟内彻底的娱乐了在座的市民们。\r\n","name":"Steamboat Willie","name_cn":"汽船威利号","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":152,"total_count":101397},{"name":"Disney","count":98,"total_count":7557},{"name":"欧美","count":90,"total_count":86067},{"name":"1928","count":86,"total_count":144},{"name":"迪士尼","count":73,"total_count":19444},{"name":"美国","count":47,"total_count":26960},{"name":"原创","count":46,"total_count":612731},{"name":"米老鼠","count":38,"total_count":96},{"name":"万恶之源","count":31,"total_count":61},{"name":"考古","count":30,"total_count":368},{"name":"剧场版","count":22,"total_count":717426},{"name":"先驱","count":21,"total_count":115},{"name":"奥斯卡","count":21,"total_count":1845},{"name":"始祖","count":19,"total_count":21},{"name":"搞笑","count":17,"total_count":631054},{"name":"童年","count":4,"total_count":92495},{"name":"1920s","count":4,"total_count":24},{"name":"1928年11月","count":3,"total_count":3},{"name":"Short","count":3,"total_count":1536},{"name":"1920-1929","count":3,"total_count":25},{"name":"短篇","count":2,"total_count":2743},{"name":"UbIwerks","count":2,"total_count":2},{"name":"WaltDisney","count":2,"total_count":11},{"name":"20年代","count":1,"total_count":1349},{"name":"经典","count":1,"total_count":23060},{"name":"【ANIME】短片丨美国","count":1,"total_count":2},{"name":"系列短片","count":1,"total_count":27},{"name":"补","count":1,"total_count":2216},{"name":"7